## Question 2: How to Update Live Portfolio in Future

### Method 1: Drag & Drop (Simplest)

```bash
# 1. Make changes to your code in VS Code
# 2. Rebuild the project
npm run build

# 3. Go to Netlify dashboard
# 4. Drag and drop the NEW 'build' folder over the old one
# 5. Site updates automatically (2-3 seconds)
```

### Method 2: Git + Auto Deploy (Professional)

```bash
# 1. Push code to GitHub
git add .
git commit -m "Updated portfolio"
git push origin main

# 2. Netlify auto-detects changes and redeploys
# (Connect your GitHub repo to Netlify once)
```

### Method 3: Netlify CLI (Advanced)

```bash
# Install Netlify CLI
npm install -g netlify-cli

# Deploy from terminal
netlify deploy --prod --dir=build
```

