## Question 3: Complete Portfolio Development Steps

### 🛠️ Tools Used

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| **React** | Frontend framework |
| **Tailwind CSS** | Styling |
| **Lucide React** | Icons |
| **EmailJS** | Contact form email sending |
| **Vite** | Build tool (or Create React App) |
| **Netlify** | Hosting |

---

### 📋 Complete Steps (From Zero to Live)

#### Phase 1: Setup (Day 1)

```bash
# 1. Install Node.js from https://nodejs.org

# 2. Create React app
npx create-react-app my-portfolio
cd my-portfolio

# 3. Install dependencies
npm install lucide-react
npm install @emailjs/browser
npm install -D tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer

# 4. Initialize Tailwind CSS
npx tailwindcss init -p

# 5. Configure Tailwind (add to tailwind.config.js)
content: ["./src/**/*.{js,jsx,ts,tsx}"]

# 6. Add Tailwind directives to index.css
@tailwind base;
@tailwind components;
@tailwind utilities;

# 7. Start development server
npm start
```

#### Phase 2: Development (Day 2-5)

```bash
# 1. Create components (Header, Hero, About, Projects, Contact, Footer)

# 2. Add all your content (experiences, education, skills, projects)

# 3. Implement dark mode toggle (use useState)

# 4. Add scroll animations and progress bar
```

#### Phase 3: EmailJS Integration (Day 6)

```bash
# 1. Create EmailJS account (free)

# 2. Get Service ID, Template ID, Public Key

# 3. Install EmailJS
npm install @emailjs/browser

# 4. Add to contact form
import emailjs from '@emailjs/browser';

const handleSubmit = (e) => {
  e.preventDefault();
  emailjs.send(service_id, template_id, templateParams, public_key)
    .then(() => alert('Sent!'))
    .catch(() => alert('Failed'));
};
```

#### Phase 4: Build & Deploy (Day 7)

```bash
# 1. Create production build
npm run build

# 2. Test build locally
npx serve -s build

# 3. Deploy to Netlify
# Drag and drop 'build' folder to Netlify

# 4. Customize URL (optional)
# Settings → Change site name → "taseer-ullah-portfolio"

# 5. Done! Site is live
```

---

